Now, at the end of the evening, there were 14 pieces remaining. The question is asking how many pieces were taken by the guests. So if there were 40 pieces to start with and 14 are left, then the number of pieces taken would be the total minus the remaining. That would be 40 minus 14. Let me do the subtraction: 40 minus 14 equals 26. 

