 The problem has some typos but given that, the problem is mostly clear.  So I need to figure out how many cars drove through the traffic jam in the first 15 minutes.  The problem says that some of the cars drive through in the first 15 minutes, then 20 more cars drive through in the remaining 15 minutes.  Also, 5 cars take an exit so they don't have to go through the jam.  The total number of cars originally was 30.  So let's think about this.

